        <p>{% trans "TODO: describe what the service does, and any availability or warranty disclaimers." %}</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content pt-2">{% trans "Your content" %}</h2>
        <p>{% trans "TODO: describe ownership of user-submitted content and the license granted to run the service." %}</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content pt-2">{% trans "Changes" %}</h2>
        <p>{% trans "TODO: describe how and when these terms may change, and how users are notified." %}</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-base-content pt-2">{% trans "Contact" %}</h2>
        <p>{% trans "TODO: provide a contact address for questions about these terms." %}</p>
    </div>
</article>
